From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tile-view <tile-view@localhost>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 04:46:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/17] Mobile: Exclude trashed and conflict notebooks from the
 tile view notebook filter

Deleted (trashed) notebooks and the virtual Trash/Conflicts entries were
being listed in the tile view's notebook filter dialog and, if selected,
their notes could show up in the filtered tile list. Notes belonging to a
trashed notebook are already excluded from the filtered query since
Note.previews() adds a deleted_time = 0 condition on its own, but the
notebook picker itself needs to filter these out before building the tree.

